<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '48px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>有人说它伧气</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>环节五 · 任务三</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ padding: '22px 28px', background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', borderLeft: '4px solid #1F3A34' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>许昂霄：此词颇带伧气，而昔人极口称之，殆不可解。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '22px 28px', background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', borderLeft: '4px solid #1F3A34' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>陈廷焯：此不过奇笔耳，并非高调。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #B4552D', paddingLeft: 24 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B4552D' }}>你同意吗？举一句词为证。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 10 }}>不举词句的表态，同意与不同意都不算。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《声声慢》· 李清照</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>14/16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>